  "about": {
    "title": "Khiva State Museum-Reserve – Historical Heritage Since 1970",
    "text": "Khiva State Museum-Reserve (established in 1970) is a major cultural and educational center dedicated to preserving and promoting the rich historical heritage of Khiva and its surroundings.\n\nThe museum houses a rich collection showcasing Khiva's ancient art, architecture, and traditional lifestyle. Beyond conserving and preserving historical monuments, it plays a key role in conducting scientific research and introducing the region's history to locals and tourists."
  },
