    "title": "Cultural Heritage Collection of Khorezm",
    "text": "The rich collection of the Khiva State Museum-Reserve features unique artifacts preserved through the centuries. Discover the history and culture of the Khorezmian people through traditional ceramics, national attire, and ancient weaponry."
